This was almost YASD...

I had just started a tourist, and was a few levels down in the dungeon. I
came across a floating eye, which wandered onto a sleeping trap and got
zapped. Since dying at this point wouldn't have been too horrible, and I
was curious what if any effect sleeping would have, I hit the eye. Sure
enough, I was frozen; I guess Eyes don't have lids... I waited to see what
my fate would be, and before long a nymph showed up and methodically
started stripping me. Then she finally got to my wand of cold, and zapped
me with it. The charge hit me, bounced off a wall and killed the nymph
without me moving a muscle. I survived and unfroze. I wish I could say I
went on to ascend, but the tourist bit the dust a short time later, in more
conventional fashion.


